'''Pixie Dust''' is an [[effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the Sweet Bundle for 3,399 Robux during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Event]].

== Appearance ==
The effect surrounds the knife with a pink and light yellow aura as well as sparkles of the same colors. When a victim is killed with this effect, their body will emit particles similar to that of the effect.

== Trivia ==

* This is the first Valentine's godly effect.
